## Method and limits

No observation window or end date can be established; the gap to today cannot be calculated. No coverage lanes, source coverage, censoring rules, or match mode were specified. Counts, if later obtained, would measure items matched under that dataset’s definitions, not the total amount of election-misinformation coverage everywhere. Tone, themes, and criticality would be classifications whose meaning depends on the method. No such measurements or interpretations are made here.

